text:
one way w/ css 🪄

stack an image 2x
filter 1st, unclip 2nd on :hover 🤙

a img { grid-area: 1 / 1; }
img:first-of-type { filter: grayscale(1) invert(1); }
img:last-of-type {
  clip-path: circle(0); transition: clip-path;
}
a:hover img:last-of-type { clip-path: circle(100%); } https://t.co/x3rAD0shsC
